Z||000002||Robert||06-11-2001||02:42 PM||||Great story for a great day. <BR>And to think, all I did was play a little tennis, and get a little tanner.  I did take Thunder out for a little spin, but I don’t think I ever got him over 4,500 RPM, just putted around some back roads.<BR>Thanks again for the story<BR>Robert<BR><P>------------------<BR>           <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF">  <P> "By the time you die, you should be so used to <BR>paying taxes that it would be almost second nature <BR>to you."<P>Will Rogers, U.S. Writer and Humorist||||reg||14
